<!-- The themed-icon layer (Android 13+): the train on its own, as one silhouette the launcher fills
     with whatever colour the wallpaper suggests.

     The same traced outline as ic_launcher_foreground, without the tiles — a themed icon is a single
     flat shape, and the tile grid recoloured into one tone would be a blue-less blue square with a
     hole in it. Sized to the 66% of the canvas the guidance asks of a monochrome layer and centred on
     the train's own bounding box rather than on the drawing's, so it sits in the middle of the mask.

     Kept in step with the foreground by hand: both come out of the same run of trace.py. -->
